# Archon's Glory {W} ("Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. If this spell was bargained, that creature also gains flying
# and lifelink until end of turn."). On turn three Bot1 bargains it (CR 702.166a: a Plains is no artifact, enchantment or token and
# is refused, Ornithopter is sacrificed), so Memnite is 3/3 with flying and lifelink and its attack gains Bot1 3 life while Bot2
# loses 3. On turn five the pump and the lifelink are gone (CR 514.2, 611.2a): Memnite is a plain 1/1 whose hit costs Bot2 1 life
# and gains Bot1 nothing.

